{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 202 days before today",
  "headline_cites": ["E13", "E16"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the dobutamine hydrochloride shortage on 2017-11-06 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E62", "E59"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our Baxter-labeled product (NDC 00338107702) is manufactured at Baxter Healthcare Corporation FEI 1416980, which FDA inspected on 2026-04-02 and classified OAI.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E16", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI inspection ended 202 days before today (2026-10-21).",
      "cites": ["E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same plant received a Warning Letter on 2026-09-29, 22 days before today.",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our Hospira-labeled product (NDC 00409234401) is made at Hospira FEI 1925262, last inspected 2025-01-17 and classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E58", "E56"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 2.4 days on hand and Corvale General has 21 days on hand and can spare 122 units while keeping two weeks.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-ranked option is to transfer 122 units from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would give Corvale East 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D16"]
    }
  ]
}
